Unlikely.  What's more than likely is one of three things:
1-You added a CP
2-You deleted a CP
3-You renamed a CP
All of which require you to go into the lua and update it in this section:
Hidden/Spoiler:
cp1 = CommandPost:New{name = "CP1"}
cp2 = CommandPost:New{name = "CP2"}
cp3 = CommandPost:New{name = "CP3"}
cp4 = CommandPost:New{name = "CP4"}
cp5 = CommandPost:New{name = "CP5"}
cp7 = CommandPost:New{name = "CP7"}
--This sets up the actual objective.  This needs to happen after cp's are defined
conquest = ObjectiveConquest:New{teamATT = ATT, teamDEF = DEF, textATT = "game.modes.con", textDEF = "game.modes.con2", multiplayerRules = true}
--This adds the CPs to the objective.  This needs to happen after the objective is set up
conquest:AddCommandPost(cp1)
conquest:AddCommandPost(cp2)
conquest:AddCommandPost(cp3)
conquest:AddCommandPost(cp4)
conquest:AddCommandPost(cp5)
conquest:AddCommandPost(cp7)

so then, from my understanding, the objective texts arent simply written in, but are "codes" that, when in-game, show the objective text defined by the certain "code".
for example:
Hidden/Spoiler:
-- OBJECTIVE ONE Conquest Objective. Capture the Jedi Concil Chamber.-----------------------
Objective1CP = CommandPost:New{name = "Consul_CP", hideCPs = false}
Objective1 = ObjectiveConquest:New{teamATT = ATT, teamDEF = GAR, text = "level.cor1.objectives.Campaign.1",
popupText = "level.cor1.objectives.Campaign.1_popup"}
Objective1:AddCommandPost(Objective1CP)
that is an objective fron the coruscant campaign, where the player captures the cp in wherever. the text is "level.cor1.objectives.Campaign.1". so, for my campaign test, instead of "capture that cp", i would put in a "code" like that? making:
Hidden/Spoiler:
--objective: conquest
Objective1CP = CommandPost:New{name = "cp2"}
Objective1 = ObjectiveConquest:New{teamATT = ATT, teamDEF = DEF, text = "if you see this, the scripter worked", popupText = "capture the command post",  AIGoalWeight = 0}
Objective1:AddCommandPost(Objective1CP)
into:
Hidden/Spoiler:
--objective: conquest
Objective1CP = CommandPost:New{name = "cp2"}
Objective1 = ObjectiveConquest:New{teamATT = ATT, teamDEF = DEF, text = "level.cor1.objectives.Campaign.1", popupText = "level.cor1.objectives.Campaign.1_popup",  AIGoalWeight = 0}
Objective1:AddCommandPost(Objective1CP)
at least, that is my understanding of it. someone please correct me if im wrong.

